<codeline lineno="62"><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">void</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>KalmanCovarianceProvider::updateAxisFilter(AxisFilter<sp/>&amp;<sp/>filter,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>sample)</highlight></codeline>
