<codeline lineno="94"><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="95"><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Error<sp/>covariance<sp/>update:<sp/>P<sp/>=<sp/>(1<sp/>-<sp/>K)<sp/>*<sp/>P_predicted<sp/>(is<sp/>equiv<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>bellow<sp/>form<sp/>=<sp/>Joseph<sp/>form<sp/>--more<sp/>stable--)</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="96"><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>filter.error_covariance<sp/>=<sp/>(1.0<sp/>-<sp/>K)<sp/>*<sp/>P_predicted<sp/>*<sp/>(1.0<sp/>-<sp/>K)<sp/>+<sp/>K<sp/>*<sp/>m_measurement_noise_r<sp/>*<sp/>K;</highlight></codeline>
